Installed through the system package manager (apt), not fetched at runtime:
fail2ban (GPL-2.0), locales, tar, iproute2, openssh-server/client, ufw.
The verbatim kejilion library may additionally install packages via its
own apt wrappers when menu items 1-14 are used; the verbatim linuxbox
bridge installs sudo/curl/wget/tar/zip via apt when item 15 is used.
